From 71129f123d786990293e835e87b77c255f9ef5ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:12:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] amd-event-log: Add AFID lookup infrastructure

Add build-time generation of the AMD Event Log (AEL)
reverse lookup table from a JSON-based configuration.

The generated lookup database provides APIs for resolving
AMD Field Identifier (AFID) metadata from event messages
and associated additional data. Static platform metadata,
including version, schema, rack location and fallback AFID,
is also exported from the generated lookup table.

Add generated unit test support derived from the same LUT
definition to validate lookup behavior and ensure runtime
and test coverage remain synchronized.

This change introduces only the AFID lookup infrastructure.
Runtime metadata providers and Redfish projection support
will be added by subsequent changes.

Change-Id: I2c1330bad818aa1415884036e2349baf1b544f77
Signed-off-by: Abhijeet Singh <abhijeet.singh@amd.com>
